{"step_index":896,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:06:55Z","thinking":"Analyzing user's requests regarding Excel color formatting, specifically focusing on shortcut keys, automated color assignment, and locating a specific colored cell. Considering the context of previous queries to understand the desired outcome – likely related to efficiently highlighting or identifying specific data within a spreadsheet.\n\n\nThe user's request appears to involve cleaning an Excel file. It's likely the user wants to remove rows with missing phone numbers or data and then color those or the remaining rows brown. The ambiguity lies in whether \"갈색채우고\" applies to the deleted rows/cells or the remaining ones. Inspecting the Excel file for existing color patterns is needed for clarification.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nasync function checkColorsDetail() {\n  const xlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명_.xlsx';\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(xlsxPath);\n  const ws = wb.getWorksheet('기업체 리스트') || wb.worksheets[0];\n\n  const fills = {};\n  const fonts = {};\n\n  ws.eachRow((r, rNum) => {\n    r.eachCell((cell, colNum) => {\n      const fill = cell.fill;\n      if (fill && fill.fgColor) {\n        const k = JSON.stringify(fill.fgColor);\n        if (!fills[k]) fills[k] = [];\n        if (fills[k].length < 5) fills[k].push({ rNum, colNum, val: cell.value });\n      }\n      const font = cell.font;\n      if (font && font.color) {\n        const k = JSON.stringify(font.color);\n        if (!fonts[k]) fonts[k] = [];\n        if (fonts[k].length < 5) fonts[k].push({ rNum, colNum, val: cell.value });\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  console.log('=== FILLS IN 배현명_.xlsx ===');\n  for (const [k, samples] of Object.entries(fills)) {\n    console.log(`Fill: ${k} (count sample: ${samples.length})`, samples);\n  }\n\n  console.log('\\n=== FONTS IN 배현명_.xlsx ===');\n  for (const [k, samples] of Object.entries(fonts)) {\n    console.log(`Font Color: ${k} (count sample: ${samples.length})`, samples);\n  }\n}\n\ncheckColorsDetail().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Check all fills and fonts in 배현명_.xlsx","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\check_all_colors_detail.js","toolAction":"Write check_all_colors_detail.js","toolSummary":"Write check_all_colors_detail.js"}}]}
