{"step_index":904,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:07:12Z","thinking":"The file names consistently include \"주황색마킹\" (orange marking). This suggests that \"orange marking\" is a critical identifier. Investigating the contents of files including that text should reveal the meaning of the marking. The goal is to understand what is being highlighted within the datasets.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nasync function inspectOrange() {\n  const xlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/배현명_실사DB_16컬럼_주황색마킹_최종검증.xlsx';\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(xlsxPath);\n  const ws = wb.worksheets[0];\n\n  console.log('Sheet name:', ws.name, 'RowCount:', ws.rowCount);\n  const markedRows = [];\n\n  ws.eachRow((r, rNum) => {\n    let hasColor = false;\n    let colorDetails = [];\n    r.eachCell((c, cNum) => {\n      const fill = c.fill;\n      if (fill && fill.fgColor) {\n        hasColor = true;\n        colorDetails.push({ col: cNum, color: fill.fgColor, val: c.value });\n      }\n    });\n    if (hasColor && rNum <= 20) {\n      markedRows.push({ rNum, cells: colorDetails });\n    }\n  });\n\n  console.log('Sample colored rows:', JSON.stringify(markedRows.slice(0, 5), null, 2));\n}\n\ninspectOrange().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Inspect orange marked excel file","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\inspect_orange.js","toolAction":"Write inspect_orange.js","toolSummary":"Write inspect_orange.js"}}]}
